GET {{Arboveya.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 56. Admin Views All Registered Users
GET {{Arboveya.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

